From: Shimazu <vanessimbolon2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 31 Jul 2026 02:19:04 +0000
Subject: TinkererInventory: Thread-safe collections and variable rename

AE PATCH REASON: ArrayList and HashMap are not thread-safe for region-thread access; obfuscated variable names hinder maintainability.
AE PATCH FIX: Replace ArrayList with Collections.synchronizedList for successfulTrades. Replace HashMap with ConcurrentHashMap for inventoryMap. Migrate Bukkit.getScheduler().runTaskLater() to Bukkit.getGlobalRegionScheduler().runDelayed(). Rename var1/var2/var3 to descriptive names throughout.
AE PATCH RISK: LOW

